msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah had been no stranger to her own body, at times when she had been alone, but Lady Carolyn seemed to know her body even better than she did herself."
msgstr "Sarah non era estranea al proprio corpo, soprattutto nei momenti in cui era sola, ma Lady Carolyn sembrava conoscerlo persino meglio di quanto lo conoscesse lei stessa."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The pressing of her lips against her neck, the gnawing of teeth, the way her hand seized her breasts and her fingers curled, sliding past her clit..."
