msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah arrived at Duke Antonio's room."
msgstr "Sarah arrivò nella stanza del Duca Antonio."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "When she entered, she found him lurched over the table, his finger running down a ledger book."
