msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah back away from them, back into the ruined house, but before she knew it, they followed her inside."
msgstr "Sarah si allontanò da loro, tornando indietro verso la casa in rovina, ma prima che se ne rendesse conto, la seguirono dentro."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "One walked inside, while the other blocked the door."
