msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "This was the gathering Gilead had told her about."
msgstr "Questo era il raduno di cui Gilead le aveva parlato."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She would need all the support she could find...but what did she really know of this Order?"
msgstr "Le sarebbe servito tutto il sostegno che avesse potuto trovare... ma cosa sapeva davvero di quell'Ordine?"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Other than what little Xan had told her."
