msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "It was hard to know who was doing what at any moment."
msgstr "Era difficile capire chi stesse facendo cosa in quel momento."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Time slipped away from her as the stimulation overpowered all her senses."
msgstr "Il tempo le sfuggì mentre la stimolazione sopraffaceva tutti i suoi sensi."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "They began in the bed."
